### ABI additions
- syscall RegisterUsbHidProducer = 423 (next free after PauseService = 422; 423 was asserted Unknown before this change)
- service::USB_HID_PRODUCER = 17 (1-13 shipped services, 14 HYPERVISOR_SERVICE_ID, 15 AI, 16 OCEL_JS -> 17 first free)
- allowlist bit: shares DriverRegistration bit 50 (bits 0-62 all assigned to syscalls, 63 is the VFS-mutate declaration: no free bit exists; same usb_driver authority as RegisterNicDriver)
- policy: scripts/sign-policy.py already carries usb_driver=1 for /bin/xhci and /bin/dwc2-usb; the syscall allowlist lives in the cell ELF, so no policy edit was required.
